The '''VCX-series auxiliary starfighter''',<ref name="Spark of Rebellion" /> also known as an '''Auxiliary Shuttle'''<ref name="Every Type of Ship">{{SWKidsYouTube|series=Star Wars By the Numbers|text=Every Type of Ship in Rebels|video=iasSt3JSV4Q|nolive=1}}</ref> or an '''Attack Shuttle''',<ref name="X-Wing">{{FFGXW2|set=Rebel Alliance Conversion Kit|cardname=Ezra Bridger|ship=Attack Shuttle}}</ref> was a short-range [[starfighter]] that was attachable to the [[VCX-100 light freighter]]<ref name="Spark of Rebellion" /> manufactured by [[Corellian Engineering Corporation]].<ref name="USW" /> The [[Spectres|rebels]] of [[Lothal]] used a [[Phantom|modified type]] of this fighter during various situations when fighting against the [[Galactic Empire|Empire]].<ref name="Fighter Flight">{{Rebels|Fighter Flight}}</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
The wreck of a starship similar in appearance to a VCX-series auxiliary starfighter appears in ''[[Star Wars: Scum and Villainy: Case Files on the Galaxy's Most Notorious]]''. However, whether it is in fact a VCX-series auxiliary starfighter remains unconfirmed.<ref name="Scum and Villainy">''[[Star Wars: Scum and Villainy: Case Files on the Galaxy's Most Notorious]]''</ref>

